=== A. Theorem thm:transport (N=60, J=1.0, h=1.0, lambda=2.0, 300 sectors, 62 times in [0,1e5]) ===
  max_t,m,q (|<N_<=m>_q - |S cap [1,m]|| - sum_{x<=m<z}|U_xz|^2) = 3.91e-14  (<= 0 required)
  max (sum_{x<=m<z}|U_xz|^2 - sum_{x<=m<z} Q(x,z))               = 0.00e+00  (<= 0)
  max (sum_x (|x-y|+1)^p |U_xy|^2 - sum_x (|x-y|+1)^p Q(x,y)), p<=2   = 0.00e+00  (<= 0)
  symmetry of U_q(t): max|U - U^T| = 3.3e-16
  F_emp (envelope of max_x E Q(x,x+d)): F(1,5,10,20,40) = 0.688, 0.28, 0.107, 0.0166, 0.000703
  moments of F_emp (truncated at d<N): M_0=4.59 M_1=24.7 M_2=262 M'_1=107  Sigma_1=20.1  Sigma'_1=97.3  Theta=908
  E sup_t |transport across the middle cut| = 0.517   (theorem: <= Sigma_1(F) <= M_1(F); with F_emp: 20.1)
  E sup_t sum_x (|x-y|+1)^0|U_xy|^2 (y=N/2) = 1.000   (theorem: <= 2 M_0(F); with F_emp: 9.18)
  E sup_t sum_x (|x-y|+1)^1|U_xy|^2 (y=N/2) = 4.603   (theorem: <= 2 M_1(F); with F_emp: 49.3)
  E sup_t sum_x (|x-y|+1)^2|U_xy|^2 (y=N/2) = 32.985   (theorem: <= 2 M_2(F); with F_emp: 523)
